# Game data

- Validate external JSON with Zod.
- IDs are stable lowercase kebab-case namespaced strings; display names are never IDs.
- References must resolve and duplicates are errors.
- Definitions contain reusable content; mutable campaign state contains instances.
- Store numbers in documented units and enforce sane ranges.
- Add provenance classification/source IDs to historically relevant release content.
- Mark fantasy and gameplay divergence explicitly.
- Keep text/localization keys separate from simulation conditionals.
- Add validation and fixture updates with schema changes.
